{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1520565-what-would-you-set-their-humanity-at","id":1520565,"title":"What would you set their Humanity at?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-08-13T19:12:57-07:00","id":1520565,"title":"What would you set their Humanity at?","content":"If you were stating these vampires, what Humanity number would you give each of them?<br /> <br /> Novel Dracula<br /> <br /> Gary Oldman Dracula<br /> <br /> &quot;Last Voyage of the Demeter&quot; Dracula<br /> <br /> Jerry Dandridge<br /> <br /> Selene<br /> <br /> Anime Alucard<br /> <br /> Spike(pre-soul-restoration)<br /> <br /> Nandor the Relentless","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-13T19:21:50-07:00","id":1520566,"title":"","content":"i don't know that last one,where are they from?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-13T19:29:48-07:00","id":1520567,"title":"","content":"&quot;What We Do In The Shadows&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-13T19:58:39-07:00","id":1520569,"title":"","content":"Novel Dracula is somewhere on Path of Evil Revelations; he\u2019s a literal Satanist whose vast magic powers came from learning black magic at Scholamanse from Satan himself.<br /> <br /> Selene is somewhere on the Path of Honorable Accord; it\u2019s basically the path for loyal soldiers and killing her betrayer absolutely fits that path morality.<br /> <br /> Netflix Castlevania Alucard is probably Humanity 7-8 with a maxed out Conscience score to keep from degeneration when he has to kill humans in self defense. He\u2019s also someone\u2019s twinked out homebrew version of a Dhampir.<br /> <br /> Pre-Soul Spike\u2019s Humanity is 0 in the 1e sense (not mindless, just irredeemably evil), just with a mechanical restraint that required him to behave more like a man to avoid punishment. Post soul he\u2019s basically been de-Wighted and is just utterly wracked with guilt for his past actions\u2026 probably stupid high Humanity and Conscience initially (hence throwing himself onto crosses to burn himself out of guilt at one point). I\u2019d say after a while he settled out at about a 6 or so Humanity.<br /> <br /> I am not familiar enough with the others to judge.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1328-chris24601","name":"Chris24601","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-13T20:12:00-07:00","id":1520570,"title":"","content":"Anime alucard is definately on Path of Night.<br /> <br /> Havent watched &quot;Last Voyage of the Demeter&quot; yet, but from from going off the trailer it looks like he/it would be following Path of the Feal Heart.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://www.nodiatis.com/pub/18.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27313-hello","name":"Hello","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27313_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-14T08:26:58-07:00","id":1520595,"title":"","content":"[QUOTE=CajunKhan;n1520565]If you were stating these vampires, what Humanity number would you give each of them?<br /> <br /> <br /> Gary Oldman Dracula<br /> <br /> I would give this version of the Count fairly low humanity rating of 3 or 4 as much as he loved or thought he loved this double of his long dead wife, he knew that the things he did to her bethrothed and her friends would certainly hurt her and poison any positive aspects of their relationship. <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Selene<br /> <br /> She seems like a vampire with a humanity of 5 or 6 with a strong honor code from what I can remember of the films, but I would need to see them again.<br /> <br /> <br /> Spike(pre-soul-restoration)<br /> <br /> I'd give 3 or 4 at best as he loved causing trouble and getting into brawls. <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-14T11:42:10-07:00","id":1520601,"title":"","content":"Novel Dracula I feel is most likely on a Path of Enlightenment of some sort, but perhaps he\u2019s holding on at Humanity 2-3 instead.<br /> <br /> The Buffy vampires are curious because I think the soul-less ones would essentially be heavily modded wights. Technically they\u2019re all at Humanity 0 but they remain intelligent and their conduct is still dominated by their Nature and perhaps a few convictions. In the case of Spike I think that\u2019s how we justify his humane behavior when lacking a soul, it aligns with his Nature (probably something like Idealist).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11637-gryffon15","name":"Gryffon15","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11637_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"900"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-14T12:38:15-07:00","id":1520605,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hello</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1520565-what-would-you-set-their-humanity-at?p=1520570#post1520570\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Anime alucard is definately on Path of Night.</div> </div> </div> </div>Are you sure you\u2019re not confusing Alucard with his father?<br /> <br /> Alucard was about protecting humanity from the deprivations of vampires and stopping Dracula from slaughtering the world. He did not even drink blood once in the series. Alucard was the antithesis of the Path of Night (by contrast I could totally see Dracula\u2019s minions as Path of Night\u2026 Dracula himself was on humanity, but spiraling into wightdom as he plotted a mass murder-suicide due to his grief at the murder of his wife).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1328-chris24601","name":"Chris24601","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-14T13:20:22-07:00","id":1520609,"title":"","content":"A more apocalyptic sort of demon did tell pre-chipped Spike (and Drusilla) that they were tainted with humanity. Though more along the lines of being hedonistic, stylish, and appreciating Art and Literature than being particularly humane. Could be low-to-middling Humanity, could be something like the Path of Cathari.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3505-matt-the-bruins-fan","name":"Matt the Bruins fan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3505_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-14T13:45:14-07:00","id":1520610,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Chris24601</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1520565-what-would-you-set-their-humanity-at?p=1520605#post1520605\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Are you sure you\u2019re not confusing Alucard with his father?<br /> <br /> Alucard was about protecting humanity from the deprivations of vampires and stopping Dracula from slaughtering the world. He did not even drink blood once in the series. Alucard was the antithesis of the Path of Night (by contrast I could totally see Dracula\u2019s minions as Path of Night\u2026 Dracula himself was on humanity, but spiraling into wightdom as he plotted a mass murder-suicide due to his grief at the murder of his wife).</div> </div> </div> </div>For anime alucard, we are referring to the one from the Hellsing anime right?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://www.nodiatis.com/pub/18.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27313-hello","name":"Hello","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27313_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-14T14:40:00-07:00","id":1520612,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hello</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1520565-what-would-you-set-their-humanity-at?p=1520610#post1520610\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> For anime alucard, we are referring to the one from the Hellsing anime right?</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah. Yes, we\u2019re discussing two different Alucards.<br /> <br /> I was referring to the Alucard from the Castlevania anime on Netflix.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1328-chris24601","name":"Chris24601","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-14T15:01:42-07:00","id":1520614,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CajunKhan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1520565-what-would-you-set-their-humanity-at#post1520565\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If you were stating these vampires, what Humanity number would you give each of them?<br /> <br /> <br /> Spike(pre-soul-restoration)<br /> <br /> I'd give 3 or 4 at best as he loved causing trouble and getting into brawls.<br /> <br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Spike is most likely Path of the Cathari at 4.<br /> <br /> <br /> None of the Buffy vampires have souls (dead bodies with a demon where their soul should be), they are all monstrous, that's why Angel and Spike getting souls is so big in universe.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gryffon15</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1520565-what-would-you-set-their-humanity-at?p=1520601#post1520601\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Novel Dracula I feel is most likely on a Path of Enlightenment of some sort, but perhaps he\u2019s holding on at Humanity 2-3 instead.<br /> <br /> The Buffy vampires are curious because I think the soul-less ones would essentially be heavily modded wights. Technically they\u2019re all at Humanity 0 but they remain intelligent and their conduct is still dominated by their Nature and perhaps a few convictions. In the case of Spike I think that\u2019s how we justify his humane behavior when lacking a soul, it aligns with his Nature (probably something like Idealist).</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bThe closest a Vampire could be &quot;Humane&quot; like Buffy Dracula, is by following a Path that values self control or discipline, and aligned with their Nature, but still nothing close to Humanity.<br /> <br /> That is why functional newborn vampires are rare, they are running on their host worst impulses (Nature) and no high Virtues, probably no Path at all, just Humanity 0. Poor impulse control + undead = cannon fodder for the Slayer.<br /> <br /> Someone did a <a href=\"http://offline.buffy.de/outlink_en.php?module=/webserver/offline/thebuffer.smithereen.net/matt/WorldofDarkness.html\" target=\"_blank\">Buffy in the World of Darkness</a>, with bloodline details, partial stats for characters, all in all very well done.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 08-29-2023, 11:31 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-14T15:20:55-07:00","id":1520619,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Chris24601</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1520565-what-would-you-set-their-humanity-at?p=1520612#post1520612\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ah. Yes, we\u2019re discussing two different Alucards.<br /> <br /> I was referring to the Alucard from the Castlevania anime on Netflix.</div> </div> </div> </div>Than yeah, Alucard from Castlevania would probably be a paragon for Humanity.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://www.nodiatis.com/pub/18.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27313-hello","name":"Hello","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27313_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-15T02:36:08-07:00","id":1520654,"title":"","content":"Nandor the Relentless is an 8 and solidly in the path to Golconda","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27429-microcuchon","name":"Microcuchon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"201"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-15T08:22:17-07:00","id":1520677,"title":"","content":"Spike has always been a strange one in the one Buffy and Angel series that even before he gained a soul at the end of season 6 that there was a humanity to him as the Judge demon mentioned in season 2 and there was debates if he still had a soul and all the ethical restrainsts were simply gone.<br /> <br /> In other words that the darker elements of Spike were just brought to the surface after Drusilla embraced him theory.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}